[00:59.086]Make my bath and kitchen very well
{"把我的浴室和厨房都打扫干净"}
[01:02.424]Je m'en moque, je ne suis pas ta voiture (I don't care, I am not your car)
{"我才不在乎 我又不是你的车"}
[01:06.025]Don't bell rings so sorry we have to go
{"别管门铃响 很抱歉我们得走了"}
[01:09.590]Pourquoi nous allons? (why do we go?)
{"为何我们要离开"}
[01:13.260]Wash my pants, everything you have to dust
{"洗我的裤子 所有你该除尘的东西"}
[01:16.933]Je voudrais mais tu n'es pas très gentil (I would like to but you're not very nice)
{"我本想答应 可你态度实在糟糕"}
[01:20.584]I forbid you to wear those kind of skirt
{"我禁止你穿那种短裙"}
[01:24.185]Laisse-moi être libre (let me be free)
{"让我自由吧"}
[01:27.739]When you walk like that and you wobble
{"当你那样走路还摇摇晃晃"}
